0..76 Comment "// This source holds two presentations wider than one round of the checker\'s"
77..148 Comment "// unfolding fuel. `Named` has 64 constants at `String`. `Flags` has 48"
149..225 Comment "// constants at `Bool`. The entries of each model check at the type that its"
226..251 Comment "// presentation computes."
252..254 Comment "//"
255..330 Comment "// `std.build`\'s `modelType` computes the type of a presentation\'s entries,"
331..407 Comment "// one entry for each constant. A wide presentation unfolds in many steps. A"
408..471 Comment "// small budget for each round of the reading cannot unfold it."
472..474 Comment "//"
475..550 Comment "// The checker reads a computed type with one budget for the whole reading."
551..625 Comment "// It fills the solved holes of the type in one walk. So one round unfolds"
626..652 Comment "// the whole presentation."
653..655 Comment "//"
656..687 Comment "// - see: #6046 — `modelType`"
688..703 Comment "// - see: #6181"
